# Normalise every text file to LF in the working tree and the index.
#
# Why this file exists: the harness repository keeps text files in LF form on
# every platform. Generators also write LF, so a checkout uses the same line
# ending regardless of the local core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary formats must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.dylib binary
